[[Image:WizardT.png|left]]''<font style="font-size:15px">{{Quote|Wizards summon the elements to attack their foes from a distance. They use magical wands to channel elemental energy into spells that can confuse enemies. They can even shoot lightning! Those who wish to learn the mystical ways of Wizardry can speak to [[Fizzlesticks]] in the [[Robgoblin Camp]] for training.|Job description}}</font>''
'''Wizard''' is a [[:Category:Members Only|Members Only]] ranged combat [[Jobs|job]], specializing in long-distance combat using magical skills and wands. This experience is gained by completing Wizard [[Quests|quests]] and by battling in combat instances in the [[Wilds]] and in [[Dungeons|dungeons]].

==Unlocking Wizard==
Wizard is unlocked by talking to [[Fizzlesticks]] in the [[Robgoblin Camp]] and completing his quests.

==Trainers==
*Fizzlesticks in the Robgoblin Camp
*[[Yaren Sunstare]] in [[Snowhill]]
*Talespinner Yvelle in [[Merry Vale]]
*[[Osgood]] in [[Sanctuary]]
*[[Sandbur]] in Sanctuary
*[[Iliya]] in [[Blackspore Swamp]]
*Sven in [[Bristlewood]]
*Karin Spellweaver in Sanctuary
*Natali in [[Lakeshore]]

